# Intentionally empty.
#
# This used to say `web`, to keep the Next app out of the static site's project. But Vercel applies this file at the repository root
# for EVERY project built from this repo, including the Next project whose Root Directory is `web`, so it stripped web/package.json from
# that build ("No Next.js version detected"). The static project is kept from serving web/ by a redirect in vercel.json instead.
